comment0.target=TrainerList
comment0.text=\r\n\ Stores\ a\ private\ collection\ of\ trainers\ keyed\ by\ name.\r\n\r\n\ The\ internal\ collection\ is\ fully\ encapsulated\ and\ cannot\ be\ manipulated\r\n\ directly\r\n\r\n\ from\ outside\ this\ class.\r\n\r\n\ @author\ Barnabe\ Jouanard\r\n\ @version\ 2026.04.13\r\n
